Z||000005||FieroSTETZ||04-09-2001||07:38 PM||||thanks for the input.. whats wierd is that it moves around (the tapping) and will go away, only to come back. i have had the valve covers off, even replaced the lifters/pushrods when i noticed there was no oil comin out, it went away for a few minutes first start afterm then went right back to it. i came so close to selling my fiero in the past 3 months (installed a new clutch, had a jack break and force a philips THROUGH my hand (all the way, was kinda cool looking back) after getting the clutch in, put a few hundred miles on, then this started. i finally decided to give up on the current motor (engine, i know) and buy a new one. found a shop that will sell me an ALL NEW 2.8, all new components (long block) even a new block, never used, for 1150 dollars. im gonna go ahead and do that, and hopefully get my car back on the road, as it was my transportation for work, and its hard to borrow cars from people for this long||||reg||1
